# Normalize line endings: the working tree had mixed CRLF/LF churn. Text files
# are stored with LF in the repo and checked out with the platform's native
# endings. Binary blobs (FITS, images, arrays) are marked so git never munges them.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.py text
*.md text
*.txt text
*.toml text

*.fits binary
*.gz binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.tif binary
*.tiff binary
*.npy binary
*.bmp binary
*.webp binary
